  "description": "A group of four chimpanzees are depicted sitting on the ground in a natural outdoor setting. One chimpanzee is sitting upright in the center, another is sitting to its left with its hand on its chin, a third is sitting to its right, and a fourth is partially visible behind the central chimpanzee. All chimpanzees are black and appear to be in a relaxed or contemplative pose. The chimpanzees are the central visual material and are used as a metaphor in the meme to represent French citizens.",
